{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization","title":"成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/cost-optimization","wordCount":1650,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本优化\">成本优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 工作负载是组织中最昂贵的云计算支出之一。GPU 实例的小时成本是 CPU 实例的 10-50 倍，大模型训练可能消耗数百万美元的计算资源，推理服务的 GPU 成本随流量线性增长。成本优化不是简单地减少资源使用，而是在保障 ML 系统性能和可靠性的前提下，最大化每单位投入的产出价值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[ML 成本] --&gt; B[训练成本]&#10;    A --&gt; C[推理成本]&#10;    A --&gt; D[存储成本]&#10;    A --&gt; E[人力成本]&#10;    B --&gt; F[GPU 计算]&#10;    B --&gt; G[数据传输]&#10;    C --&gt; H[常驻实例]&#10;    C --&gt; I[流量处理]&#10;    D --&gt; J[模型存储]&#10;    D --&gt; K[数据存储]\">graph TB\n    A[ML 成本] --&gt; B[训练成本]\n    A --&gt; C[推理成本]\n    A --&gt; D[存储成本]\n    A --&gt; E[人力成本]\n    B --&gt; F[GPU 计算]\n    B --&gt; G[数据传输]\n    C --&gt; H[常驻实例]\n    C --&gt; I[流量处理]\n    D --&gt; J[模型存储]\n    D --&gt; K[数据存储]</pre><p>ML 成本优化的核心思路是从训练、推理和存储三个维度系统化地寻找优化空间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本维度</th>\n<th>占比（典型）</th>\n<th>优化潜力</th>\n<th>优化难度</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练 GPU</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理 GPU</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据存储</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人力（工程时间）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"训练成本优化\">训练成本优化</h2><p>训练成本优化的核心策略是提升 GPU 利用率和缩短训练时间。GPU 利用率低是训练成本浪费的最大根因——调研显示，大多数组织的 GPU 训练集群平均利用率不足 30%。</p>\n<p>竞价实例（Spot/Preemptible Instances）是降低训练成本的最直接手段。AWS Spot Instances 的价格通常是按需实例的 30-40%，但可能被随时回收。对于可容忍中断的训练任务，配合检查点恢复机制，竞价实例可以将训练成本降低 60-70%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class SpotAwareTrainer:&#10;    def __init__(self, config):&#10;        self.config = config&#10;        self.checkpoint_interval = config.get(&quot;checkpoint_minutes&quot;, 30)&#10;&#10;    def train(self):&#10;        start_step = self.load_checkpoint_if_exists()&#10;&#10;        for step in range(start_step, self.config[&quot;total_steps&quot;]):&#10;            loss = self.train_step(step)&#10;&#10;            if self.should_checkpoint(step):&#10;                self.save_checkpoint(step)&#10;&#10;            if self.spot_termination_notice():&#10;                self.save_checkpoint(step, urgent=True)&#10;                self.request_new_instance()&#10;                break&#10;&#10;    def spot_termination_notice(self):&#10;        try:&#10;            resp = requests.get(&#10;                &quot;http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/spot/instance-action&quot;,&#10;                timeout=1,&#10;            )&#10;            return resp.status_code == 200&#10;        except Exception:&#10;            return False\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpotAwareTrainer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.checkpoint_interval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"checkpoint_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        start_step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.load_checkpoint_if_exists()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start_step, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.train_step(step)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.should_checkpoint(step):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.save_checkpoint(step)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spot_termination_notice():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.save_checkpoint(step, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urgent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.request_new_instance()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spot_termination_notice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            resp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests.get(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/spot/instance-action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp.status_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span></code></pre></div><p>混合精度训练（Mixed Precision Training）通过使用 FP16/BF16 进行前向和反向传播，将训练速度提升 1.5-2 倍，同时减少显存占用使得可以使用更大的 batch size。梯度累积允许在小 batch size 下模拟大 batch size 的训练效果，使得较便宜的 GPU（如 A10G 替代 A100）也能训练大模型。</p>\n<p>训练任务调度的优化也不可忽视。通过分析训练任务的资源使用模式，将互补的任务混合调度到同一组 GPU 上（如一个 GPU 密集型任务和一个 CPU 密集型任务共享节点），可以提升整体资源利用率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[训练任务] --&gt; B{成本优化}&#10;    B --&gt; C[竞价实例]&#10;    B --&gt; D[混合精度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[梯度累积]&#10;    B --&gt; F[任务混排]&#10;    C --&gt; G[成本降低 60%]&#10;    D --&gt; H[速度提升 2x]&#10;    E --&gt; I[更便宜 GPU]&#10;    F --&gt; J[利用率提升]\">graph LR\n    A[训练任务] --&gt; B{成本优化}\n    B --&gt; C[竞价实例]\n    B --&gt; D[混合精度]\n    B --&gt; E[梯度累积]\n    B --&gt; F[任务混排]\n    C --&gt; G[成本降低 60%]\n    D --&gt; H[速度提升 2x]\n    E --&gt; I[更便宜 GPU]\n    F --&gt; J[利用率提升]</pre><h2 id=\"推理成本优化\">推理成本优化</h2><p>推理成本在模型上线后会持续增长，通常成为 ML 系统中占比最大的支出项。推理成本优化需要从模型优化、服务优化和资源优化三个层面入手。</p>\n<p>模型级优化包括量化（INT8/INT4 降低每次推理的计算成本）、剪枝（减少模型参数量）和蒸馏（用小模型替代大模型）。这些技术在前面的章节已经详细介绍。在成本视角下，关键是量化模型的精度损失与成本节约之间的 ROI 计算。</p>\n<p>服务级优化的核心是提升 GPU 利用率。动态批处理将多个请求合并为一个 batch 执行，使 GPU 的并行计算能力得到充分利用。模型共置（Model Co-location）将多个低流量模型部署到同一块 GPU 上，避免每个模型独占一块 GPU 导致的资源浪费。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class CostAnalyzer:&#10;    def __init__(self, gpu_cost_per_hour, model_configs):&#10;        self.gpu_cost = gpu_cost_per_hour&#10;        self.configs = model_configs&#10;&#10;    def analyze_inference_cost(self, model_name, daily_requests):&#10;        config = self.configs[model_name]&#10;        latency_ms = config[&quot;avg_latency_ms&quot;]&#10;        gpu_count = config[&quot;gpu_count&quot;]&#10;&#10;        requests_per_second = daily_requests / 86400&#10;        gpu_utilization = (requests_per_second * latency_ms / 1000) / gpu_count&#10;&#10;        daily_cost = gpu_count * self.gpu_cost * 24&#10;        cost_per_request = daily_cost / daily_requests&#10;&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;daily_cost&quot;: daily_cost,&#10;            &quot;cost_per_request&quot;: cost_per_request,&#10;            &quot;gpu_utilization&quot;: gpu_utilization,&#10;            &quot;monthly_cost&quot;: daily_cost * 30,&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def optimize_recommendation(self, analysis):&#10;        recommendations = []&#10;        if analysis[&quot;gpu_utilization&quot;] &lt; 0.3:&#10;            recommendations.append(&quot;考虑模型共置或缩小实例规格&quot;)&#10;        if analysis[&quot;cost_per_request&quot;] &gt; 0.01:&#10;            recommendations.append(&quot;考虑模型量化降低单次推理成本&quot;)&#10;        return recommendations\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CostAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, gpu_cost_per_hour, model_configs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gpu_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu_cost_per_hour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.configs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_configs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyze_inference_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_name, daily_requests):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.configs[model_name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        latency_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avg_latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        gpu_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpu_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        requests_per_second </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        gpu_utilization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (requests_per_second </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latency_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        daily_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gpu_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cost_per_request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"daily_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: daily_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"cost_per_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cost_per_request,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"gpu_utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: gpu_utilization,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"monthly_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: daily_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> optimize_recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, analysis):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        recommendations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpu_utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            recommendations.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"考虑模型共置或缩小实例规格\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_per_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            recommendations.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"考虑模型量化降低单次推理成本\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recommendations</span></span></code></pre></div><p>资源级优化包括自动扩缩容（根据流量动态调整实例数量）、预留实例和储蓄计划（对稳定的基线负载使用预留实例降低成本）、以及区域选择（选择 GPU 价格更低的云区域）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化层面</th>\n<th>具体策略</th>\n<th>成本降低</th>\n<th>实施复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型级</td>\n<td>INT8 量化</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型级</td>\n<td>知识蒸馏</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务级</td>\n<td>动态批处理</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务级</td>\n<td>模型共置</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源级</td>\n<td>竞价实例</td>\n<td>60-70%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源级</td>\n<td>预留实例</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源级</td>\n<td>自动扩缩容</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"finops-实践\">FinOps 实践</h2><p>FinOps（Financial Operations）是将财务管理实践引入云计算运营的方法论。在 ML 场景中，FinOps 的核心目标是建立成本透明度、成本问责制和成本优化的持续循环。</p>\n<p>成本透明度要求将云计算账单拆分到每个团队、每个项目和每个模型级别。通过资源标签（Tag）标记每个 GPU 实例、存储桶和网络资源的归属，结合云厂商的成本报告工具（AWS Cost Explorer、GCP Billing），生成多维度的成本仪表盘。</p>\n<p>成本问责制要求每个团队对自己的 ML 资源支出负责。设定团队级的成本预算和告警，当某个团队的 GPU 支出超过预算时自动通知团队负责人。定期进行成本审计，识别和清理闲置资源（如长时间未使用的模型端点、过期的训练数据备份）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[成本数据采集] --&gt; B[多维度归因]&#10;    B --&gt; C[团队/项目/模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[成本仪表盘]&#10;    D --&gt; E[预算告警]&#10;    E --&gt; F[优化行动]&#10;    F --&gt; G[效果验证]&#10;    G --&gt; A\">graph TB\n    A[成本数据采集] --&gt; B[多维度归因]\n    B --&gt; C[团队/项目/模型]\n    C --&gt; D[成本仪表盘]\n    D --&gt; E[预算告警]\n    E --&gt; F[优化行动]\n    F --&gt; G[效果验证]\n    G --&gt; A</pre><p>单位经济学（Unit Economics）分析是 ML FinOps 的高级实践。它将成本归因到业务指标上——每次模型预测的成本、每个活跃用户的 ML 成本、每增加 1% 准确率的边际成本。这些指标帮助决策者评估 ML 投入的商业回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-资源利用率优化\">GPU 资源利用率优化</h2><p>GPU 利用率是 ML 成本优化的核心指标。低利用率意味着昂贵的 GPU 资源在空转。提升 GPU 利用率需要从任务调度、资源分配和工作负载优化三个维度入手。</p>\n<p>GPU 分时复用（Time-Slicing）允许多个推理任务共享同一块 GPU 的计算时间。NVIDIA MPS（Multi-Process Service）提供了更细粒度的 GPU 共享能力，允许多个进程同时访问 GPU，减少上下文切换开销。对于小模型推理，GPU 分时复用可以将单 GPU 的利用率从 10-20% 提升到 60-80%。</p>\n<p>GPU 显存超售（Memory Oversubscription）在推理场景下是一种激进但有效的策略。如果多个模型的显存占用总和超过 GPU 物理显存，但它们不会同时被密集访问，可以通过显存交换（GPU Memory Swap）到主机内存来实现超售。这种策略适用于多模型低流量的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class GPUUtilizationOptimizer:&#10;    def __init__(self, gpu_inventory):&#10;        self.gpus = gpu_inventory&#10;&#10;    def analyze_utilization(self):&#10;        report = []&#10;        for gpu in self.gpus:&#10;            util = gpu.get_utilization()&#10;            memory_util = gpu.get_memory_utilization()&#10;            report.append({&#10;                &quot;gpu_id&quot;: gpu.id,&#10;                &quot;compute_util&quot;: util,&#10;                &quot;memory_util&quot;: memory_util,&#10;                &quot;status&quot;: self._classify(util, memory_util),&#10;            })&#10;        return report&#10;&#10;    def _classify(self, compute, memory):&#10;        if compute &lt; 0.2 and memory &lt; 0.3:&#10;            return &quot;idle&quot;&#10;        if compute &lt; 0.5:&#10;            return &quot;underutilized&quot;&#10;        return &quot;healthy&quot;&#10;&#10;    def recommend_actions(self, report):&#10;        actions = []&#10;        idle_gpus = [r for r in report if r[&quot;status&quot;] == &quot;idle&quot;]&#10;        if idle_gpus:&#10;            actions.append(f&quot;发现 {len(idle_gpus)} 块空闲 GPU，建议释放或合并工作负载&quot;)&#10;        return actions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPUUtilizationOptimizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, gpu_inventory):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gpus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu_inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyze_utilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        report </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gpus:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            util </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu.get_utilization()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            memory_util </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpu.get_memory_utilization()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            report.append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"gpu_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: gpu.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"compute_util\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: util,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"memory_util\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: memory_util,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._classify(util, memory_util),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _classify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, compute, memory):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"idle\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"underutilized\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"healthy\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recommend_actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, report):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        actions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        idle_gpus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> report </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"idle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idle_gpus:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            actions.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"发现 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(idle_gpus)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 块空闲 GPU，建议释放或合并工作负载\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actions</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((成本优化))&#10;    训练优化&#10;      竞价实例&#10;      混合精度&#10;      利用率提升&#10;    推理优化&#10;      模型量化&#10;      动态批处理&#10;      模型共置&#10;    FinOps&#10;      成本透明度&#10;      预算问责&#10;      单位经济学&#10;    GPU 优化&#10;      分时复用&#10;      显存超售&#10;      资源整合\">mindmap\n  root((成本优化))\n    训练优化\n      竞价实例\n      混合精度\n      利用率提升\n    推理优化\n      模型量化\n      动态批处理\n      模型共置\n    FinOps\n      成本透明度\n      预算问责\n      单位经济学\n    GPU 优化\n      分时复用\n      显存超售\n      资源整合</pre><ul>\n<li>ML 成本优化需要从训练、推理和存储三个维度系统化推进</li>\n<li>竞价实例 + 检查点恢复是训练成本优化的最直接手段，可降低 60-70% 成本</li>\n<li>推理成本优化需要模型级（量化/蒸馏）、服务级（批处理/共置）和资源级（扩缩容/预留）三层协同</li>\n<li>FinOps 实践建立成本透明度和问责制，单位经济学分析帮助评估 ML 投入的商业回报</li>\n<li>GPU 利用率是成本优化的核心指标，分时复用和模型共置是提升利用率的有效手段</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本优化","id":"成本优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"训练成本优化","id":"训练成本优化"},{"level":2,"text":"推理成本优化","id":"推理成本优化"},{"level":2,"text":"FinOps 实践","id":"finops-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 资源利用率优化","id":"gpu-资源利用率优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ML 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/ml-platforms"},"next":{"title":"治理与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/governance-compliance"}}